-- Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj (map 509, the 20-man raid): the plan for the run leader (.bot run), exported from turtle-agent
-- prep/raid-aq20 71d2148 (dungeons/ruins_of_ahnqiraj.json, status 'draft (not mapped, not live-checked)') with
--   turtle-agent plan-export --dir dungeons --mmaps <map 509 mmaps> --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops \
--     --rev 71d2148 --stamp 20261028120000 --out <this file> ruins_of_ahnqiraj
-- NO ROW IS HAND-SET: the plan, leg and step rows below are the exporter's output; this header, the ai_dungeon_boss
-- block and the ai_boss_tactic block are the prep's own (task B1, ~/TortoiseBots-audit/RAID-PREP-aq20.md).
--
-- What the prep changed from the dungeongen draft (6 legs, 132 pull groups, no via or approach points):
--   * 132 pull groups (302 units) become 102 (230 units). Not in a pull: the 49 Rajaxx event units (the 7 captains
--     15385-15392 and their six escorts each, 15344 Swarmguard Needler and 15387 Qiraji Warrior: the hold fights
--     them), Andorov and his four Kaldorei Elite (15471/15473, faction 1608, gossip), the 6 bosses, and the 19 Canal
--     Frenzy (15505) in the sunken water channel below the Moam corridor (z 4.7-13.8; the draft's one pack of them
--     was its needs_walk failure). Lone spawns chain where they stand within 15 yd on one floor (|dz| <= 4) and the
--     server walk between them is at most 2.2 times their distance plus 8 yd, up to 12 units; a pull's reach (radius
--     + 3) takes the lone spawns standing in it; a patrol or a creature-group unit never moves. Radius = the pack's
--     own spread from its centre + 5 yd (the raid pull rule), at most 35. One creature group (spawn 1242591) is not a
--     pack: its five Vile Scarabs stand 1125 yd apart.
--   * Legs follow the rooms and floors: entrance_hall (the terrace, z 31.7-36.2), kurinnaxx (the arena and the boss),
--     andorov_camp (the gossip that starts Rajaxx's event), general_rajaxx (the hall's two Qiraji Gladiator pairs and
--     the hold), moam (the north corridor and the boss), buru_the_gorger (the plateau, the pit last and the boss),
--     ayamiss_the_hunter (the west hive and the boss), ossirian_the_unscarred (the eight Anubisath Guardian patrols
--     and the boss on his platform).
--   * Every pull and every boss carries an approach stand (16-30 yd from a member, on the pack's floor, a complete
--     server path from the point before it, 20 yd clear of every pull made later and of every Rajaxx wave spawn): 107
--     approach rows (102 pulls, 5 bosses), so the run leader never walks toward a pack it cannot see in hops of its
--     own; 426 path rows cut the long walks between the legs and the wide packs.
--   * Rajaxx's event (leg 3): the gossip row (15471, menu index 0 = "Let's find out.") is in leg 2, before the hall,
--     because the wave units are pre-placed in the hall and aggro on entry (pulling one starts Andorov's script too).
--     Leg 3's row 32 is a hold: the party stands on -9105.2 1610.7 23.5 and fights the waves until instance data 2
--     (TYPE_RAJAXX) reads 3, Rajaxx's death (creature_ai_events 1534102). The hold is written with flag 8 alone (a
--     plain data value, not an encounter state) because the data leaves 0 only when Rajaxx (the seventh wave) aggros,
--     far past the loader's 30 s "the start did not take" check.
--   * 40 patrol blocks (all 40 patrolling trash spawns; the 41st path is Kurinnaxx's own) are in the plan and NOT in
--     the rows: the run leader pulls the pack where it stands.
--   * The map has no static door, lever or key: its 7 game objects are Scarab Coffers (180691), left alone, and door
--     176149 is summoned while any boss is in combat and deleted after (instance Update). Ossirian's crystals (180619)
--     are summoned two at a time during the fight: the bots' own `ossirian` fight strategy clicks them, no row.
--
-- plan-check (turtle-agent plan-check --mmaps <map 509 mmaps>): ok, 352 points on the navmesh, 0 failures, 0
-- run-leader hops, 40 warnings, all "the patrol of ... has only an estimated period_s": the mapping walk (B2)
-- measures the rounds. The ROWS: 8 legs, 650 steps (541 move, 102 pull, 5 boss, 1 hold, 1 gossip), 659 rows with the
-- plan and leg rows.
--
-- WHAT THE RUN LEADER CANNOT DO (nothing is dropped silently). Not in these rows: the entrance and teleports (the run
-- leader starts inside the instance), the level band, the raid size (no column), the leg skip lists, the patrol
-- blocks, and the wait_for's own condition beside Rajaxx's hold (a unit 15341 dead within 80 yd; the hold row is the
-- run leader's form, the wait is the agent's). The boss list below gains Rajaxx (15341), who has no boss row: his
-- leg is the event and the hold is its step.

-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- ruins_of_ahnqiraj: map 509, 8 legs, 650 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'ruins_of_ahnqiraj';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'ruins_of_ahnqiraj';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'ruins_of_ahnqiraj';
--
-- ai_dungeon_boss (map 509): the six bosses' entries and names from the core's creature_template (all rank 3), so the
-- dashboard crowns the bosses of a map whose plan boss rows are Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru, Ayamiss and Ossirian; Rajaxx
-- (15341) has no boss row (his leg ends in the event's hold) and is in this list all the same.
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (509) AND `entry` IN (15339, 15340, 15341, 15348, 15369, 15370);

-- Kurinnaxx (15348): Wide Slash 25814 (boss_kurinnaxx.cpp UpdateAI, every 12-15 s on the victim) is a frontal cleave;
-- 10 yd is a judgement (the 1.12 client DBC is not in this data set). His Mortal Wound 25646 tank swap is not one of
-- the three kinds (community patch 326 does it).
-- Ayamiss (15369): the paralyse sends a Hive'Zara Larva 15555 (boss_ayamiss.cpp SummonCreature) to the paralyzed raider;
-- its SPELL_FEED 25721 summons a hornet from the hive. Killing the larva first stops the sacrifice (community patch
-- 328g focuses the same unit with a strategy).
DELETE FROM `ai_boss_tactic` WHERE `map` = 509 AND `boss_entry` IN (15348, 15369);
